	(text_box "DESIGN NOTE:\nCALC - CRYSTAL LOAD\nCL = (C28 x C29)/(C28 + C29) + Cstray\n   = (12 x 12)/24 + ~5 = 11 pF\nSelected a crystal specified for CL = 11-12 pF."
