	(text_box "SPEC:\nADC CHANNEL MAP\n  FILTER_SOA  PB11  ADC1_IN14 / ADC2_IN14   (both)\n  FILTER_SOB  PB12  ADC1_IN11               (ADC1 only)\n  FILTER_SOC  PB14  ADC1_IN5                (ADC1 only)\n  VBAT_SENSE  PB0   ADC1_IN15\n  TEMP_SENSE  PB1   ADC1_IN12\n  MOT_TEMP    PB2   ADC2_IN12\n\n  Simultaneous dual-ADC sampling MUST pair SOA (on ADC2) with SOB or\n  SOC (on ADC1). Phases B and C can NEVER be sampled simultaneously.\n  Derive the third phase from Ia + Ib + Ic = 0."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 309.88 45.72 0)
		(size 83.82 38.1)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.508)
			(type solid)
