	(text_box "FIRMWARE - MANDATORY AT BOOT\n  1. Program nSWBOOT0 = 0 so BOOT0 comes from the option bit,\n     not PB8 (PB8 = FDCAN1_RX).\n  2. Set PWR_CR3.UCPD1_DBDIS = 1 BEFORE enabling TIM1.\n     PA9/PA10 (PWM_PHASEB_H / PWM_PHASEC_H) are UCPD1_DBCC1/2.\n     A high level enables internal 5.1k pull-downs on PB6 (UART TX)\n     and PB4 (PWR_LED).\n  3. DRV_nFAULT -> PA15 = TIM1_BKIN (AF9). Configure as a hardware\n     break input, not EXTI.\n  4. ESTOP -> PC3 = TIM1_BKIN2 (AF6), active HIGH (loop open)."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 160.02 130.356 0)
		(size 36.83 42.364)
		(margins 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525 0.9525)
		(stroke
			(width 0.508)
			(type solid)
			(color 0 0 255 1)
		)
